{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 929,
  "batch_count": 14486,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ed570bdae9a8a9fc0a2c9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘位于队伍中间时稍微放慢速度\\n并回复大量体力,当耐力有\\n十二分充足时,之后在终盘\\n会长时间持续向前突击",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efaea96fc1e3bf9d98c4e29e3c4b3c2c1f0e1053e8b37110ba7f060101df2ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110741"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110741"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199a521ccd15d8897350595d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于中团时\n提升速度，若是长距离比赛且\n若中盘曾发生过竞争，则极大提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86fa7dd17055288c08e41bfe36f87a4149503fd5d719952a49091f034100524",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110761"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110761"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49f7abd6da79e8bf4dd79ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时通过技能恢复耐久力\\n比赛中段附近以后处于有利位置时\\n速度会稍微提升,如果距离终点\\n还很远则会大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb6236b01a8fcc2c93e230a67402fd763a9d3743fcb81cb40a37dc477c2e964",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110771"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110771"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038b1ce37a97238c07b1f647",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余350m的位置位于前方时\\n短时间内向前突进,若是英里比赛\\n则额外稍微增加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f253d2970e105323e871f2dd3f4104d988ed5beac28813d5269a4b4a9f90bcea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110781"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110781"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ebd42e0fa97b418777a4ee5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时若位于前方则会在短时间内\\n大幅提升速度，之后在比赛中段\\n附近被紧追时会略微向前冲出\\n＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a0d0611241555e0cc3f48f9f6b642dd72348dcdad0b846ec20151dec6203e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110801"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0386aaa488d55289bfddcfd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道处\\n一段时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "df403ca50cd4375b84430db94a1f0f64e3a4dca10f5e1cd7d53e321f20f0e7a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110801111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e945f3a226c66834766ff1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道处或者中山竞马场的\\n终盘弯道处位于中后方时\\n加速度提升,之后在最终直线处\\n稍微提升速度＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0515438df6b278ee290a23e65b37b9f0a1e6cffb652155af170e55a1e68a20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110801211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110801211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f93ff889a731cc9edbaf8a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段若位于中间集团以后\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n若在英里比赛中一直保持在后方\\n则速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "af03b7f7a30ee5d0da06d66655b5a44e2563dd1a62ba44eb7ea07ce95310cb83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110821"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110821"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:686a1998b01d5cb93a4ba999",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛进行到一半位于队伍中间时,在最终直线处\\n提升速度,如果是中山竞马场的中距离比赛\\n则变为极大提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e14a5b8b5714fabb0f81a624bf5b0e92b121a73f8ae4cc5512a6713fa7406d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110831"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110831"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de818267924cf68191cfd96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段处于后方时会稍微向前突进\\n在英里赛中如果一直保持在最后方附近\\n会大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb6b9a70eff4972796b052239a817b4ef8e74f6a62b1b490f5fde6880a8ff7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110841"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110841"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02461e3015d0956f8f43ddda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛进行一半左右若位于中间位置\\n则速度少量提升,如果是英里比赛\\n则进一步增加效果和持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2b6a7388fe9d6b1b6c527d75d581e3b92bf548c39324fc06a6555a2ff99841",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110851"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110851"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ceda686f9846e696f6a9800",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,发动技能时\\n若位于领头或距离领头2马身以内\\n则速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd9e7fe2683bf44365bb8e960db1168e848fc961245c96622cb23eca61c760e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110861"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110861"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22f218dbb3c0b08e68a8cf40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短距离比赛的赛程近半若位于前方\\n则速度提升,若智力有十二分高超\\n则大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1572195c60f129ff2c625e5729bfed879a6af9c2e550a39ec77736879894ead",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110871"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110871"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f0d8dda81246c368fe8996",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期进行超越时\\n短时间内大幅向前突进\\n若是中距离比赛则短时间内\\n极大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c402da608abd028a42adc362f12032ff9264d6c4bd54148e20a8e18e0ac8b443",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110881"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110881"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee361a82eae900e3a552b6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中程附近若位于中间位置\\n则长时间持续少量提升速度,并回复耐力\\n若比赛距离小于3000m,则不回复耐力\\n并长时间持续提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed7d1840b233ff3faaa00631aa4d366804aeda805af07e8904f1a4e35681a4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110891"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110891"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb802a43193e791b7906228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2a4f6102e0fb90ee006b68e123ec6f6b01620dd6e699dd7ad142b1fbc6491d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e07e1a0845683db4502405",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于前方时\n提升速度，此外若是东京赛场\n则额外稍微提升速度<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e568ffcdcdf45363900ad90a1ba18a31dc653cf6f13e4e907f7c993044705531",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110901121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4dd00b4a02a5e7d34e51ffb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时提高加速度\\n之后在剩余200m处速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd97dd302350ac61e202ff50244769dd832486ff2870abda45cbdb8e6dbe2a35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3636aaa97e359d8de676403f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心中怀抱继承下来的强烈心愿\\n在比赛后半段大幅向前突进\\n并小幅回复耐力＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f035f2f7e66192702491cb03676b57ac79e86f2f58afe9a17ecf17450a8ea66a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110902111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110902111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0171ccc4273e7821ab20320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下坡时加速度提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a225156365c89cc3e5b3fe5106baae12ec1a9334835314e3c6d65b13a1d071",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110902211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110902211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90d9b09539e51c0ef442c15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的第3弯道位于\\n中间位置时,速度少量提升\\n若是2000m的比赛且此时是上坡\\n提升技能效果与持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d9b80674c0e07708a91965603d41a4644b40dd82c6a7ead4f055cc28dd7724",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110911"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110911"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b087a35026f2c4bcad437953",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在队伍中游进行过竞争时\\n最终冲刺时速度提升,若是短距离比赛\\n且在技能发动时位于前三名\\n则额外稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "79be933f400bf0975b31c4eea98463949d75738e132873d6a16b9801c7d2b0d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110931"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110931"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321f23e81a91a2c72c410bea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在中间集团及以后发生切磋时\n速度提升，若是中距离比赛\n则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78d79dc11bab12c352b2048e8e18af56d3b5c68ebc9b0ac9a5f2d48b88d3be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110941"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110941"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8325e15a779885f1af9898e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段位于前方时\\n如果距离终点较远则会向前冲刺＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25021ba0496f116d875fbe904cb384f34a8448faf0d1ba8cedf657426af7a91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110981"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110981"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc13f4857779ff3cb5467754",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛半程少量提升速度\\n且在沙土比赛发动技能时\\n若不在第3弯道\\n则额外稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8874772b22a7c62ea5d4b67d204897da840c1b787a6f413ba926808f85430e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110991"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/110991"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128602e4550a2edcf4c110ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于第3名及以后\n且正前方或正后方长时间有赛马娘时\n短暂向前突进\n若是泥地比赛则持续向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd7deca05375a1c96d8c8974e6a121fc1b6cfd5a48d917a6a2c11848422c57f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24adc0e4f52d69ba9d7f4f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于有利位置时\\n一段时间内速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d46f857ae8d1f1a9870cc1640bad95534e7e9b7f5f7c7480402205aa964786",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111001111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601c6ccc1c80afb321816360",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时稍微放慢速度\\n之后在比赛终盘初期极快向前突进\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e674d4ec18f18fb19df40d99bf1d97b773b186c8d54c694e7f8425f44bf2ec7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111001211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111001211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e916205fc00027c1e2867c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n速度和加速度少量提升＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "94674449691c94c703d10d10a43a9171ebd05f0a4bdb0100a2248d620daa01e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111002111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111002111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1621ad4eb467cbdb0b88418",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d804446b27f86e8ff7d3f1bb6d5bdebef16dacb7aebcff768fb46ccc6b5cce6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111002211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111002211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c04d9f915000bdc02d71eb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段为止保持在前方的话\n在终盘的最终直线提升速度\n若是中距离比赛则大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9907f3cd442f922f27c91f06bcd823e5e1c78a1e0c1123e6078a4b58de58fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0b99b0d95b672def3a8224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中距离比赛的前半段若能保持\\n名次位于前方,则长时间内速度持续少量提升\\n若发动了「大逃」技能,则效果改变\\n变为大幅回复耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64dd6a7959e1b1d21a24200da9b3fb63a95dba2e573cb577e75a30a592bbd0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111041"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111041"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a2d49b3ab670d15f68643be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于第二名开外\\n则速度提升,若比赛中盘正好\\n发动7次或是13次技能\\n则变为速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d22f4693ec666a5c4ddec7d173c4a497af27cc7b4ac97198e624c0043c4f5cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111051"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111051"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8514cd9d161a3a5f04a75150",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘准备超越时\\n短时间内小幅向前突进,之后在\\n终盘的最终弯道后半位于中后方时\\n短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8dca9054046c75a15078fff33cd4d4c631e2b56f0e0ce308652f2c3f52666d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111061"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111061"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7719cf3c8179be32776814",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘逼近时若处于前方\\n持续小幅度提升速度\\n若在前三名内则持续小幅度增加加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f4a7772838b9333c0458b90ef5e26b3a0fa740f7af398e6fc6ec304c45a5f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111071"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111071"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd7addace24598db477308c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是三后冠的赛道\\n则在终盘的弯道短时间内小幅向前突进\\n如果此时为下坡,则额外稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe6a939b38aca79aa3f14de2911cb31cdb73588f1f047a9777b3936cf836680",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111091"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111091"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9ee38a5268c7e4d4377226",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段短时间内速度大幅提升\\n如果是中距离比赛\\n效果会更加显著＜战术·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "594cebd6a08ebca64751b438bcd23e62507ee70314c768b738038be28beac670",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111101"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d470f6b29b124520565fc60f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若智力有十二分高超则提高效果量\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fece8b3839fc7eb66fa8a97ab1ca54d9bdae4331d5fa52144be2255b5c3cd14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111101111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5654b17dbfcf048e48f9b11f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的初期位于队伍中后方时\\n速度提升,之后进入比赛后半段的下坡时稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "129261166111ff0fa748a1e261a3628bd369b4803025cfa6976f7668b4edef99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111101211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111101211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4cb64722c84ec1fca3eecb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于前方\\n被靠近时,速度少量提升\\n若为中距离比赛且干劲为绝好调\\n则速度进一步略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d308fb19991c2faf940572be2e4636874e8411f45738efba3ac105886a3db19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111131"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111131"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1720f3cba8ab8f14ded83522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间点位于中团时\\n在剩余400m处速度大幅提升\\n技能发动时若处于有利位置\\n则效果提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dcf1a0a0ed91dea24ca195b3b99ff6a5d5da977ed27d5f8a4ea16d475b8a06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111161"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111161"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bbb770247dea7d7bb5d502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m地点位于后方时短暂略微向前突进，\n若是长距离比赛，之后若在终盘的弯道超越过\n则在最终直线短暂提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d4bc25be3defd232d4ef45f7ec5c347c13a1bf8d7859a4ac38d2af8cd035443",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111191"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111191"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a574aa37ffc650fa9f8628fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若是英里赛则效果进一步提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "595350d921964dea04b78f91dace2fd7a39e0ae8bfea4fb706461e999a7a25b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111201111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111201111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6af7618a7d8db1b3c141abf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n若是英里赛则效果进一步提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "595350d921964dea04b78f91dace2fd7a39e0ae8bfea4fb706461e999a7a25b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111201211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111201211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2941252a9d5c54792c237469",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于前方时\n短暂略微向前突进，若是英里或中距离比赛，\n之后在最终直线短暂大幅向前突进<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec7f8dfd0b6384edab6ce10c748ff116ba574b2ca937671bafd85265511b8199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe0557759469a7d74f5e395",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时速度大幅提升\\n若是2200m的比赛则速度极大提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bdbb08116804ffcb88c97c616eca4471fc6e1a1cc0911e55df13b429824546",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111301111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111301111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8039ce1307b25a1fb045a7f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于前方时加速度大幅提升\\n若是2200m的比赛,则消耗少量耐力\\n使加速度在终盘初期更早时间内大幅提升＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "73470816d9f41e6f5ecd5997edd876055ab8282b70a8e984a1f5d9e9effeb273",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111301211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111301211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afec9ef900b79cd9fbda074",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "速度十二分迅速时,速度\\n大幅提升,并且若干劲为绝好调\\n则所有基础能力略微提升\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8673853a39127761934af4ed41c6bf5c13bc3d07c91a209e478d6e6a95db8e31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111302111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111302111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631b232106057f02c2a6cd9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛最后阶段初段的随机位置\\n若处于最后冲刺阶段,则速度提升\\n若干劲为绝好调则极大提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "448000a9ea59543bfb04c70bb080d11b9d4b0d9310d563f2f0f80f9838ca5773",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111302211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111302211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b1f4f774f3314789fd1c99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的直线上若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度持续稍微提升\\n若在海外赛场则效果增强",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ef0970d8d708aaf6c60e5cdf9a7ebd6319b058705a2fac6615c733168382ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111321"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111321"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e382890bb840ff86397cf1f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "1600m～2500m的比赛则在最终弯道前的第3弯道向前突进\n若是根干距离的比赛则持续一段时间\n大幅向前突进<作战·追赶>",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30bcfcac77039773fa4cc6b4f391324cc216d21893db2cd2b17e058b87bb60e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3489b5fb919319dd177add",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里比赛的终盘初期或中距离比赛的终盘\n最终弯道提升加速度\n并略微向前突进<追赶·草地>",
      "source_fingerprint": "1181cb384aa61efd7c8acf7c50ba8e8771ac4e59237ce8a29ee5d2dc43d31f70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d2831a947a97d37d40845d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是2000m以上的比赛\\n则在最终冲刺时提升加速度\\n＜追赶・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "162b51c97745823946030e4278ff60d8ce2eb587c0cce455054969fde5cade4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111501111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111501111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71ea92e950159722a12a387",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于中后方时\\n速度提升,之后临近比赛终盘时\\n小幅向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f47043c85ee835ac249487139db1a02fcc3c6e6150a4f757e05040a16a4440b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111501211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111501211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71cf9cb392026e182a57189a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期若位于中后方\\n则速度大幅提升,并少量\\n回复耐力＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc6cebfa8e886f85f049d2c53dd78e66a969c624a5c9420354f678dc5add760f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111501221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111501221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac13e8328f9d28ecd437186d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在距离2000m以上的比赛,终盘初段的初期\\n前方拥挤时,加速度提升并更擅长回避\\n前方不拥挤时,在终盘初段的初期\\n该技能依旧发动＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce5b8bc56498eedb354a520bfd6359be792f3b820fe40e5a93a31ed9fed78cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111601111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111601111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af44c8ebbe604940b9b1fb6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b42a3561cfe5be6ca15446fe9e78f7307ae20868339c5e3a96a52c75913d31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111601211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111601211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ba4bf15ccdcf39c6f45ae11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在距离2400m～2500m的比赛中\\n临近终盘时,速度大幅提升\\n如果力量有十二分强劲,则速度极大提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9b4abb9475c0995775165f6d4cec1890cf9e4b134dbf6bd3d44f0e7d953afe9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111601221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111601221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64641c2a77088f57df3b921",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第3弯道\\n位于中团及以后时向前突进；此外\\n若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则稍微提升加速度＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc069940cf0603bf93508de7ff74af1395d4dc3fd302e08423f8a866bdaffb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111602111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111602111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc4efbf17a75a5a2b12e6dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将进入终盘时\\n若位于中团及以后则提升速度\\n若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则速度极大幅度提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c48430103273c7c9f48243ec1c0aaacf2b67039c640c26a13a232cc95ee8d54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111602211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111602211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b9f2e43ac5b7315c71737d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段准备超越时\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "82bbe0c51e24abb7d7586c5f01b4b22a9822b86c2e5a608647e8822fab1ad75c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71068695f0aab6e823d6616",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘尝试超越时\\n速度提升且稍微回复耐力\\n＜追赶・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79872b0d4a04cfb0fae97e992656ef052001810d60a8bd79256fadcade863c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111701121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111701121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16232add40d68ee215321e6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道一段时间内\\n向前小幅突进,之后在最终直线稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e7b5023e0c64613d875b803c14488ba3224fca35e60cc5b3bbeba93115fbe5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111701211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b766ff1fb243430f8f52ac38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的一段时间内\\n速度略微提升\\n此后若在全力冲刺期间处于有利位置\\n展现出良好的冲刺势头＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1142ec8a77e905f5ab32e97f895ae291956607bc808037aad9ce5ef0ab17ae54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111801111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111801111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b8e4645defeb6273315c600",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段加速度稍微提升\n并稍微向前突进\n随后在全速冲刺阶段若处于好位置则提升冲刺性能\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "74312a7896c125fa7c5657d81466ee5b647d4203207e60a9ef22886d08ba5129",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111801211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111801211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b97260d221f2fd73130b1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "擅长顺时针场地\\n速度和力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7814c15fa8627cde840a95f8a4e57e31d746a2cd8a41a7e73247c9b4db4ee9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064b56c5ecd1e40a736dae29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道准备超越时\\n一段时间内向前突进\\n若为中山竞马场且智力有十二分高超\\n则技能效果提升＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53a7baf64d5a0ee52d92fc274e49e51da0200526d9bfe6d5ee34be47c2d0344",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30621abd99274d5dd2a8ff2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期若余力十分充足\n则持续一段时间向前突进\n智力极为充足时效果增加<追赶·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "78db8e9016bc580531cc3a135f63e27c2e6b210228a7e188745653d58127ffa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111902111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111902111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e43ce806746d2516840df0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段试图超越时速度提升，\n且包含自身在内的队伍成员速度稍微提升<追赶·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15c5c2cdeff64f1a9b094df3fb3c7e618a999eb7bdf0781a6289d28906dc35a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "111902211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/111902211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9b4a731c87926e7220c89b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度略微提升\\n之后在直线上向前突进＜领放・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4c9852b4466cdb305df03b3d63b91fb1e64517e4414b26265c9dfb6bed99fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112001111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112001111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2a3cae6af3e87fdeab1812",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "开赛时稍微向前突进\n随后进入中盘直线时向前突进\n＜领放・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "03d9f39781d9cee69292408e6fc3830a6db4b5a550f7e4918cfcaf58b135c619",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112001121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112001121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e075964101597f68298cc802",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度略微提升\\n之后在直线上向前突进＜领放・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4c9852b4466cdb305df03b3d63b91fb1e64517e4414b26265c9dfb6bed99fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112001211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112001211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03ab2e133963ad1fea6afa8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时,消耗耐力\\n使速度极大提升＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f510adf26c7438b43e9a6c5927817ce1d11e68f1cf4de7e3d043fb12c95d9e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112101111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112101111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded3959794ca5f30ba6a833b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘准备超越时加速度提升\\n发动技能时,如果位于最终弯道\\n则变为加速度大幅提升＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0150e59473d8d06adbf2770b0df04353dda9ef2f8b92bf2ba446c67da54c40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112101211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112101211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d58c16173faa293be5ece3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将进入终盘时,一段时间内速度稍微提升\\n若是在英里或中距离发动该技能,且位于领头\\n或者距离领头2马身以内,则一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e0478b648bd24d16193216e3d5fe6e8f0a200391249e8c4b159c8ef9efe4111",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a9f3b6d45951a3c9a334b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛剩余200m时速度少量提升\\n或者在英里或中距离比赛的最终直线上\\n位于领头或者距离领头1马身以内时\\n以极快速度向前突进＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "13bc9aa8d74291f81db17a48b8192f12e678bf6d3d6c26f5f6dc4ef3f2587813",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ea6277cab823bf99b2eb02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "位于领头或试图超越时提升速度，若是东京赛场则之后\n在终盘的最终直线略微向前突进<英里/中距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e7dd96e9416a5c777ff91529269ee31f76633ae81272600e0e1de3488bb4c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112402111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112402111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8679a53a977416e90bcf878",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘迫近时提升速度\n若是英里或中距离比赛则之后\n在终盘的最终直线稍微向前突进<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "44240c2a069dfba8a01b469c6621021da76dc4d3770d8381300249355eb39881",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112402211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112402211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d95f22e91f4b2a97ce3e2aad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期大幅回复耐力\\n若是3200m及以上的比赛\\n则额外稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a8425176bd2bca7161e0f5c9de261afd6fd0cf7a9a13f23e488127613b081c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793f3894cc2ce1364f24cf6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是3200m及以上的比赛,则在比赛终盘\\n提升加速度,之后在最终直线\\n稍微提升速度＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df4e64e5cf878445db366d241a2670a02690d7b172ef50bc42f59e3191ec204",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/112701211"
    }
  ]
}
